.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Lightweight whole-body artwork and optional physics\&. 


.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
\fBAPI Stability: 2 — Evolving\fP\&. This API is implemented and supported, but its contract is still settling\&. Compatibility is preserved where practical; breaking changes are documented in release notes\&. See \fBAPI stability\fP\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
ParticleEffects 
.RE
.PP

.SH "Member Function Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "\fBParticle\fP clearContent ()"

.PP
Remove the artwork\&. Preserves transform, size, lifetime, physics and emitter\&. 
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
This \fBParticle\fP\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
ParticleEffects 
.RE
.PP

.SS "expire ()"

.PP
Expire immediately\&. Idempotent\&. Removes the particle from its layer, disconnects physics constraints, detaches its shared solver and stops its emitter\&. Retained particle/component references stay valid\&. 
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
ParticleEffects 
.RE
.PP

.SS "\fBParticle\fP fadeTo (number opacity, number seconds, int easing = \fR\fBlinearTween\fP\fP)"

.PP
Schedule a whole-particle fade\&. Uses the same \fBwait()\fP/andThen() timeline as movement and size changes\&. Fading to zero does not expire the particle\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIopacity\fP Target opacity from zero to one\&. 
.br
\fIseconds\fP Finite nonnegative duration in seconds\&. 
.br
\fIeasing\fP Easing function (C++) or constant (JavaScript); default linearTween\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
This \fBParticle\fP\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
ParticleEffects 
.RE
.PP

.PP
References \fBpdg::linearTween\fP\&.
.SS "number getAge ()"

.PP
Read elapsed simulation time\&. 
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
Age in seconds, clamped at expiry\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
ParticleEffects 
.RE
.PP

.SS "\fBSpriteLayer\fP getLayer ()"

.PP
Read the owning layer\&. 
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
The layer, or null when detached or expired\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
ParticleEffects 
.RE
.PP

.SS "number getLifetime ()"

.PP
Read the configured lifetime\&. 
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
Seconds; zero means unlimited\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
ParticleEffects 
.RE
.PP

.SS "number getOpacity ()"

.PP
Read whole-particle opacity\&. 
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
Opacity from zero to one\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
ParticleEffects 
.RE
.PP

.SS "\fBParticleEmitter\fP getParticleEmitter ()"

.PP
Read the optional owned emitter\&. 
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
The emitter, or null\&. Reading never allocates it\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
ParticleEffects 
.RE
.PP

.SS "boolean hasContent ()"

.PP
Test whether artwork is assigned\&. 
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
True for an assigned \fBImage\fP or \fBDrawing\fP\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
ParticleEffects 
.RE
.PP

.SS "boolean isAlive ()"

.PP
Test whether the particle has expired\&. 
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
True until \fBexpire()\fP or automatic expiry; detached particles may still be alive\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
ParticleEffects 
.RE
.PP

.SS "removeCollider ()"

.PP
Detach the optional collider\&. Restores collider to NoCollider\&. Retained collider references remain valid\&. 
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
ParticleEffects 
.RE
.PP

.SS "removeParticleEmitter ()"

.PP
Stop and detach the owned emitter\&. Retained emitter references remain valid; its previous emissions continue living\&. 
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
ParticleEffects 
.RE
.PP

.SS "removePhysicsBody ()"

.PP
Detach the optional body\&. Restores physics to NoPhysics\&. Retained bodies preserve state but lose their owner, constraints and shared solver\&. 
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
ParticleEffects 
.RE
.PP

.SS "\fBParticle\fP setDrawing (\fBDrawing\fP content)"

.PP
Assign whole-particle \fBDrawing\fP artwork\&. Sets the logical size to the artwork bounds\&. Later setSize/grow/resizeTo operations map the complete artwork into that size\&. Artwork is shared; edits to a shared \fBDrawing\fP remain visible\&. No image subsection or Spriter playback is exposed\&.

.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
JavaScript artwork methods require a GUI build\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIcontent\fP Artwork to retain; JavaScript parameter is named content\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
This \fBParticle\fP\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
ParticleEffects 
.RE
.PP

.SS "\fBParticle\fP setImage (\fBImage\fP content)"

.PP
Assign whole-particle \fBImage\fP artwork\&. Sets the logical size to the artwork bounds\&. Later setSize/grow/resizeTo operations map the complete artwork into that size\&. Artwork is shared; edits to a shared \fBDrawing\fP remain visible\&. No image subsection or Spriter playback is exposed\&.

.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
JavaScript artwork methods require a GUI build\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIcontent\fP Artwork to retain; JavaScript parameter is named content\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
This \fBParticle\fP\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
ParticleEffects 
.RE
.PP

.SS "\fBParticle\fP setLifetime (number value)"

.PP
Set the lifetime in simulation seconds\&. Default 1; zero disables automatic expiry\&. Changing lifetime preserves age\&. The next update expires a particle whose age has reached its lifetime\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIvalue\fP Finite nonnegative seconds\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
This \fBParticle\fP\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
ParticleEffects 
.RE
.PP

.SS "\fBParticle\fP setOpacity (number value)"

.PP
